This repository is published for reference and portfolio purposes only.

The *approach* described here — the deterministic gate, the role split, the
autonomy dial, the ladder — is offered freely as an idea. Reusing the files
themselves is not. If you want to, open an Issue and ask.

Quotations from Andrej Karpathy, Andrew Ng, Cognition and LangChain remain
the property of their authors and are used, with attribution and links, for
commentary and criticism.

